@startuml
title Sequence Diagram - 004 Opening Several Questions at Once

actor Teacher
participant "Teacher Question Board" as Board
participant "Open / Close / Close-All Routes" as API
participant "Round Store (Lua)" as Store
database "Private Redis" as Redis
participant "Activity SSE" as Sync
participant "Student A" as StudentA
participant "Student B" as StudentB
participant "Writeback Worker" as Worker

Teacher -> Board : Tick Q1 and Q2, press 開放所選題目
Board -> API : POST rounds/open { questionNumbers: [1, 2] }
API -> Store : openRounds(teacher, [1, 2])
Store -> Redis : EVAL open-rounds.lua
alt Any question missing / unconfirmed / completed / already open / duplicated
  Redis --> Store : { error, questionNumber }
  Store --> API : 409 / 422 with question number
  API --> Board : Error; nothing opened
else All questions openable
  Redis -> Redis : openRoundIdsByQuestion[1..2] = roundIds;\nHSET round hashes; one phase.changed per round
  Redis --> Store : { rounds: [Q1, Q2], stateVersion }
  Store --> API : opened rounds
  API --> Board : 200 rounds[]
  Sync -> Redis : read events
  Sync --> Board : phase.changed (Q1), phase.changed (Q2)
  Sync --> StudentA : phase.changed (Q1, Q2)
  Sync --> StudentB : phase.changed (Q1, Q2)
end

par Independent rounds
  StudentA -> API : POST rounds/{Q2}/submissions answers[]
  API -> Store : submitAnswer(Q2 round, A)
  Store -> Redis : EVAL submit-answer.lua\n(open map[Q2] == roundId)
  Redis --> StudentA : receipt order 1 for Q2
else
  StudentB -> API : POST rounds/{Q1}/submissions answers[]
  API -> Store : submitAnswer(Q1 round, B)
  Store -> Redis : EVAL submit-answer.lua\n(open map[Q1] == roundId)
  Redis --> StudentB : receipt order 1 for Q1
end
Sync --> Board : submission.accepted (per round)

Teacher -> Board : Tick Q3, press 開放所選題目 (Q1, Q2 still open)
Board -> API : POST rounds/open { questionNumbers: [3] }
API --> Board : Q3 opened

Teacher -> Board : 結束本題 on Q1
Board -> API : POST rounds/{Q1}/close
API -> Store : closeRound (strict)
Store -> Redis : EVAL close-rounds.lua [Q1]
Redis -> Redis : phase closed; remove Q1 from open map;\nresults.finalized (Q1)
Sync --> StudentA : results.finalized (Q1) - Q2, Q3 stay open
StudentA -> API : late answer for Q1
API --> StudentA : 409 此搶答回合已結束 (Q2/Q3 still accept)

Teacher -> Board : 結束全部開放中
Board -> API : POST rounds/close-all
API -> Store : closeAllOpenRounds
Store -> Redis : GET activity (open map: Q2, Q3)
Store -> Redis : EVAL close-rounds.lua [Q2, Q3] (open-only)
Redis -> Redis : close both at one instant;\nresults.finalized per round;\nphase = completed when every question is closed
Redis --> Store : { rounds: [Q2, Q3] }
API --> Board : closed rounds
Sync --> StudentA : results.finalized (Q2), (Q3)
Sync --> StudentB : results.finalized (Q2), (Q3)

opt Per-question writeback
  Teacher -> Board : 回填得獎答案 on a closed card
  Board -> API : POST rounds/{roundId}/writeback
  API -> Redis : enqueue-writeback.lua (re-queue when previous job failed)
  Worker -> Redis : XREADGROUP job
  Worker --> Sync : writeback.status
  Sync --> Board : 回填處理中 / 已回填 / 回填失敗 (重新回填)
end
@enduml
